What Are DMT Vape Pens?

DMT vape pens are specialized devices designed to vaporize and deliver N,N-Dimethyltryptamine through inhalation.
They look similar to regular vape pens you might see people using for nicotine or cannabis. But instead of those substances, these devices contain DMT in liquid or crystalline form.
The pen itself has a few basic parts. There’s a battery-powered heating element, a cartridge that holds the DMT, and a mouthpiece. When you activate the device, it heats the DMT just enough to turn it into vapor without burning it. You then inhale that vapor directly into your lungs.
These pens have gained popularity because they’re discreet and portable. You can carry them easily and use them without the preparation required for traditional methods.
